  "details": "Creating a new instance, joining other instances and other parts of VRChat's menus are broken when joining this world. Appears to happen both on desktop and VR. Mostly happens when having low framerate (~30 fps), with higher framerates like 60 everything works fine, but I cannot confirm that this is in anyways related to the framerate. \n\nTo repoduce join the world, open up the menu and try creating a new instance of any VRChat world. This bug seams to be present both in stable and open beta.\n\nwrld_cac764e2-de1e-4c6e-bc93-0a13ddf6b039",
